@startuml EGIN_Concise_Context
title EGIN — System context (prob-period-1)
top to bottom direction
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowFontSize 17
skinparam footerFontSize 16
skinparam footerFontColor #496353
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam nodesep 28
skinparam ranksep 34
skinparam ArrowColor #316548
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #F3F7F4
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #316548
skinparam actorBorderColor #316548
skinparam actorFontColor #173C29
actor "Farmer / field worker" as farmer
actor "External developer" as developer
rectangle "EGIN\nWeb/PWA + Node.js API\nPlots, weather, sync, reports" as egin #E2F0E7
rectangle "Separate developer portal\nAPI reference and scoped keys" as portal
rectangle "EGKN public map\nParcel boundaries" as egkn
rectangle "Open-Meteo\nCoordinate forecasts" as weather
rectangle "Customer 1C\nRead-only OData" as onec
rectangle "Pending integrations\neGov / Smart Bridge\nSensor telemetry" as pending #FAFAFA;line.dashed
farmer -down-> egin : browser
developer -down-> portal : browser
portal -left-> egin : API access
egin -down-> egkn : via API adapter
egin -down-> weather : client directly
egin -down-> onec : via API connector
egin ..> pending : planned only
egkn -[hidden]right-> weather
weather -[hidden]right-> onec
footer Summary of the frozen design; current availability is qualified in the report.
@enduml
